| **USB:**         | No                |
| **[[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial|Serial]]:** | [[#Serial|Yes]]  |
| **[[docs:techref:hardware:port.jtag|JTAG]]:**     | [[#JTAG|Yes]]    |

